@page "/"

<PageTitle>GDS Blazor Components Demo</PageTitle>

<GdsHeading Level="1">GDS Blazor Components Demo</GdsHeading>

<p class="govuk-body-l">
    Welcome to the GDS Blazor Components demonstration application. This site showcases the various components available in the <GdsLink Href="https://github.com/Dorset-Council-UK/GdsBlazorComponents">GDS Blazor Components library.</GdsLink>
</p>

<GdsInsetText Text="This is just a demo for the Blazor Components library, and does not suggest any best practices for creating GDS style forms" />

